                                "sense_id": "77e8264a-308d-3b0b-a182-ea22ad9dc385",
                                "text": "In these environments the cryoconite, a wind-borne fine debris deposited on glacier surfaces, represents a potential sink for organic and inorganic pollutants because of its high content of organic matter."
                            }
                        ]
